 is traversed clockwise. \n\nAmong the given options, the only positively oriented simple closed curve is the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14041961/assets/96fce932083e7f439c10774984db6af1fbd6bf76aba3746bccb0de4c89e61320.png)"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186314315 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "337518a9-39a1-57e3-8686-74a135f7c3d7" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Oriented Curves"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "073751d6-809d-517a-9612-b19b4e8d62e0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314317} {:answer/id #uuid "931465c2-8302-58a7-8e19-5e5ec32b11ba" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "III and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314318} {:answer/id #uuid "4ce92ffb-0a7d-5024-a8e4-864fef5c0bd2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "I, II and IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314319} {:answer/id #uuid "0aa94449-91cb-5d5f-a5c7-ea94f0405ac9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "IV only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314320} {:answer/id #uuid "8bef00c5-b09c-5268-8895-6f57bc7f6885" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314321}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8bef00c5-b09c-5268-8895-6f57bc7f6885" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "II only" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314321} :answer-field/id #uuid "b60d84be-fdc5-590e-a7f5-385a34916f2d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314316}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045465 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3ac63652-779c-5f2e-92d7-35bb06ca1b62" :question/math-academy-id "q-98338" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/mul